; A total price on a posting without units is dropped, and the posting is
; not an auto-posting: beside two currencies it cannot be sorted into a
; Currency group, and the transaction is dropped. Beside one currency it
; is booked in that one.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Wallet
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "a total price without units beside two currencies"
  Assets:Wallet  1.00 USD
  Assets:Wallet  2.00 EUR
  Assets:Cash @@ 20 USD

2020-01-03 * "beside one currency"
  Assets:Wallet  1.00 USD
  Assets:Cash @@ 20 USD

2020-01-04 balance Assets:Wallet 1.00 USD
2020-01-04 balance Assets:Cash -1.00 USD

2020-01-05 open Assets:Euro
2020-01-05 * "fund an account in one currency"
  Assets:Euro  5.00 EUR
  Assets:Wallet

2020-01-06 * "beside two currencies, from an account holding one"
  Assets:Wallet  1.00 USD
  Assets:Wallet  2.00 EUR
  Assets:Euro @@ 20 USD
